6P06 B 0 A_CountDown
6P06 B 1 A_SetScale(ScaleX-0.1)
6P06 C 0 A_CountDown
6P06 C 1 A_SetScale(ScaleX-0.1)
6P06 C 0 A_CountDown
6P06 C 1 A_SetScale(ScaleX-0.1)
6P06 D 0 A_CountDown
